# Original single-passage situations: text, purpose, detail and implication.
DATA=r'''
Exhibition panel return|RETURN INSTRUCTIONS\nThe reusable exhibition panels must be returned in their numbered sleeves. Small scuff marks from normal use are included in the hire fee; holes or adhesive residue may incur repair charges. Photograph any existing damage before packing. The courier appointment covers collection from the loading bay only. If you need the panels carried from an upper floor, tell us before the collection date so that additional handling can be arranged.|To explain the return conditions for hired panels~To advertise new exhibition furniture~To confirm that every repair is free~To cancel a courier contract|Normal scuff marks are included in the hire fee~All adhesive damage is included~Upper-floor carrying is automatically included~Numbered sleeves should be discarded|Request extra handling before collection if needed~Leave panels upstairs without notifying anyone~Cover damage with permanent adhesive~Assume every type of damage is free|Hướng dẫn trả panel; trầy nhẹ thông thường đã gồm nhưng lỗ/keo có thể tính sửa; nhận chỉ từ bến, bê từ tầng trên cần hẹn trước.
Interview room booking|ROOM BOOKING UPDATE\nInterview rooms can be reserved in blocks of up to ninety minutes. The final ten minutes of each block are for clearing the room and resetting equipment, so they should not be counted as interview time. Longer assessments require two linked blocks approved by recruitment. Please remove candidate notes when leaving; the next booking may be for a different department. A room reservation does not include an interviewer or technical support.|To clarify what an interview-room booking covers~To recruit technical support staff~To announce unlimited interview lengths~To distribute candidate notes publicly|A ninety-minute block provides less than ninety minutes of interview time~Technical support comes with every booking~Candidate notes should be left for the next department~Longer assessments need no approval|Arrange linked blocks for a longer approved assessment~Use cleanup time as guaranteed interview time~Leave confidential notes on the table~Assume a room booking supplies an interviewer|Khối90phút có10phút dọn nên thời gian phỏng vấn ngắn hơn; bài dài cần hai khối được duyệt; phải mang ghi chú ứng viên đi.
Community repair queue|REPAIR CAFE\nWe assess items in arrival order, but an assessment is not a promise that a repair can be completed that day. Some work needs specialist parts or skills. If we cannot proceed safely, we will explain the limitation and may suggest another service. Please bring accessories needed to demonstrate the fault. Volunteers do not charge for their time, although replacement parts may have a cost that must be agreed before fitting.|To explain a community repair service~To guarantee same-day repairs~To sell every donated item~To recruit only paying customers|Replacement parts can involve an agreed charge~Every part is free~Arrival order guarantees a completed repair~Unsafe repairs must always continue|Bring accessories that help demonstrate the fault~Assume all work can finish immediately~Approve unknown charges after fitting~Leave out information about the fault|Đánh giá theo thứ tự đến không bảo đảm sửa trong ngày; công tình nguyện miễn phí nhưng linh kiện có thể tính và phải đồng ý trước.
Client workshop remote access|To: Workshop participants\nThe in-person workshop remains at10A.M.on Friday. Remote participants should join ten minutes early for an audio check. The meeting link is personal and must not be posted to public pages. If a colleague wishes to attend instead, ask us to transfer the registration; forwarding the link alone will not update the attendance record or grant access to the follow-up materials. A recording of the introductory presentation will be shared afterward, but group discussions will remain private.|To explain remote participation arrangements~To cancel the in-person workshop~To permit unlimited public link sharing~To announce recordings of every discussion|Forwarding a link does not transfer the registration~Remote attendance begins after the workshop ends~Every discussion will be published~Colleagues automatically receive all materials|Request an official transfer for a substitute attendee~Post the link on a public page~Assume a forwarded link updates all records~Skip the audio check because it is mandatory afterward|Học trực tiếp vẫn10h; người từ xa vào sớm; chuyển người cần đổi đăng ký, không chỉ chuyển link; chỉ ghi phần giới thiệu.
Equipment delivery exception|DELIVERY NOTE\nThe replacement freezer arrived with a damaged external handle. The delivery team recorded the damage, but the receiving signature confirms only the number of packages, not acceptance of their condition. A replacement handle is scheduled for Tuesday. Until it is fitted, staff should not force the door with improvised tools. Contact facilities if access is urgently required; they will arrange an approved method with the supplier.|To document a delivery problem and temporary restriction~To confirm unconditional acceptance of every defect~To authorize improvised repairs~To advertise a new freezer model|The signature does not approve the item's condition~The handle was replaced before delivery~Staff may force the door with any tool~The number of packages is unknown|Contact facilities for urgent access~Treat the signature as acceptance of all damage~Repair the handle without approval~Ignore the recorded defect|Ký nhận xác nhận số kiện, không chấp nhận mọi tình trạng; tay nắm thay thứ Ba; không tự cạy cửa, cần dùng cách được duyệt.
Travel workshop funding|PROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT\nThis fund pays approved course fees up to400dollars. Travel and accommodation are considered separately and are not automatically approved when the course is accepted. Staff must provide the course outline and explain its relevance to their work before booking. An attendance receipt alone is insufficient for reimbursement if prior approval was required but not obtained. Questions about exceptions should be raised with the development coordinator, not the course provider.|To explain the limits of a training fund~To offer automatic reimbursement for every trip~To authorize bookings without review~To set a course provider's prices|Course approval does not automatically cover travel~Every hotel charge is included~A receipt replaces all prior approval~The provider decides internal exceptions|Seek approval before making the required booking~Assume the fee cap covers unlimited expenses~Ask a provider to waive company rules~Submit only a receipt after ignoring approval|Quỹ phí khóa tối đa400đô, đi lại/ở xét riêng; cần duyệt trước và nêu liên quan công việc; biên nhận không thay phê duyệt bắt buộc.
Reusable cup survey|CUSTOMER NOTICE\nOur reusable-cup trial is being extended for two weeks. Return rates improved after we added an evening collection point, but the trial has not yet covered a full holiday period. We will collect more data before deciding on permanent arrangements. Deposits remain unchanged during the extension. Customers may return a cup at either collection point regardless of where it was borrowed, provided the cup belongs to this program.|To explain an extended service trial~To announce a permanent decision already made~To increase cup deposits immediately~To require returns at the original location only|A full holiday period has not yet been evaluated~The improvement proves every condition has been tested~Deposits increase during the extension~Only the original collection point accepts returns|Use either program collection point~Return unrelated cups for the same deposit~Assume all arrangements are permanent~Stop collecting data during the extension|Thử nghiệm kéo dài vì chưa đủ mùa nghỉ; tiền cọc không đổi; cốc đúng chương trình trả ở một trong hai điểm đều được.
Temporary reception duties|To: Front-desk cover staff\nDuring the renovation, greet visitors at the temporary desk but do not issue building-access cards yourself. Security will verify identity and activate the cards. You may record arrival and contact the host while that check takes place. If the host cannot be reached, visitors should remain in the waiting area. The temporary location changes where we greet people, not the authorization needed to enter controlled areas.|To define duties at a temporary reception desk~To transfer all security authority to cover staff~To close every visitor waiting area~To allow entry whenever a host is absent|Greeting visitors does not authorize card activation~Every receptionist may activate cards independently~Unreachable hosts mean automatic entry~The renovation removes access checks|Contact the host while security completes verification~Issue a card without security approval~Send visitors into controlled areas alone~Treat the temporary location as a waiver|Đổi nơi đón không đổi thẩm quyền; lễ tân ghi đến/liên hệ chủ trì, an ninh xác minh và kích hoạt thẻ; chưa gặp chủ trì thì chờ.
Creative studio estimate|ESTIMATE FOR WINDOW DISPLAY\nThe quoted price covers design and one installation visit. It assumes the supplied measurements are accurate and the existing mounting points are suitable. If a site inspection reveals different conditions, we will send a revised estimate before extra work begins. Printed samples are included, but a full-size prototype is optional and separately priced. Approval of this estimate does not authorize additional work at an unspecified rate.|To state assumptions and limits of an estimate~To guarantee every site condition~To include unlimited visits and prototypes~To approve unknown extra charges|Extra work requires a revised estimate~A full-size prototype is automatically included~All measurements have been independently verified~Every installation visit is free|Review revised costs if site conditions differ~Approve unspecified rates automatically~Assume all prototypes are included~Ignore inaccurate measurements|Giá dựa số đo/điểm gắn phù hợp; phát sinh cần báo giá sửa trước làm; mẫu in gồm nhưng nguyên mẫu cỡ thật tính riêng.
Library reading-space rules|QUIET STUDY AREA\nThe upper reading room is reserved for individual quiet study. Short online calls should be taken in the bookable booths on the lower floor, even when headphones are used. A booth booking is limited to one hour when others are waiting. Bags may be left beside your seat during a brief break, but doing so does not reserve an empty desk all day. Staff may clear unattended desks after the posted limit.|To clarify the use of study spaces~To allow calls anywhere with headphones~To sell permanent desk reservations~To close the lower-floor booths|Headphones do not make calls suitable for the quiet room~A bag reserves a desk indefinitely~Booth bookings have no limit~All online calls are prohibited throughout the building|Use a lower-floor booth for a call~Make calls at a quiet-study desk~Reserve several desks with bags all day~Ignore posted unattended-desk limits|Phòng trên học yên lặng, gọi online sang buồng dưới kể cả đeo tai nghe; đặt buồng giới hạn khi có người chờ; túi không giữ bàn vô hạn.
Supplier contact change|NOTICE TO CUSTOMERS\nFrom July1, routine order queries should go to our shared service address rather than an individual salesperson. Existing orders keep their reference numbers and agreed delivery dates. Urgent delivery-day problems can still be reported to dispatch by phone. The change is intended to prevent queries being missed when an employee is absent; it does not require customers to open a new trading account.|To announce a change in routine contact arrangements~To cancel existing order references~To change every agreed delivery date~To require new customer accounts|Existing order details remain in force~Every customer needs a new account~Urgent dispatch calls are prohibited~Individual absence will cancel an order|Use the shared address for routine queries~Send every query to an absent salesperson~Discard all current order references~Reapply for credit before contacting anyone|Đổi đầu mối hỏi thường sang hộp chung, không đổi mã/ngày đơn hay yêu cầu tài khoản mới; sự cố gấp ngày giao vẫn gọi điều phối.
Group ticket name changes|GROUP BOOKINGS\nYou may change the names on unused group tickets until noon on the day before the event. The change does not increase the number of places and does not move the booking to a different date. Discount eligibility must still be met by the replacement attendee. Send the booking reference and revised list together; separate messages for each name can delay processing. Used tickets cannot be transferred retrospectively.|To explain conditions for group-ticket substitutions~To offer extra places with every name change~To transfer all used tickets~To remove discount eligibility checks|Replacement attendees must satisfy the discount conditions~A name change adds another seat~Dates change automatically~Used tickets may always be reassigned|Send one revised list with the booking reference~Send no reference number~Assume a substitute inherits any discount regardless of status~Transfer a ticket after it has been used|Đổi tên trước hạn không thêm chỗ/đổi ngày; người thay vẫn đủ điều kiện giảm; gửi mã và danh sách sửa cùng nhau.
Community kitchen hire|KITCHEN HIRE CONDITIONS\nThe community kitchen fee includes normal electricity use and standard cleaning materials. Hirers must remove food waste and leave surfaces clear; the fee does not cover washing personal utensils left behind. Equipment faults should be recorded at the start of the session, before food preparation begins. Additional storage outside the booked period requires agreement. A cupboard left full after the session is not an automatic extension of the booking.|To explain responsibilities when hiring a kitchen~To include unlimited storage in every booking~To offer free washing of all private utensils~To authorize unreported equipment faults|Storage beyond the session requires agreement~Leaving items extends the booking automatically~All personal washing-up is included~Faults should be reported only after use|Record equipment faults before preparing food~Leave waste for the next group~Claim permanent cupboard space~Assume private utensils will be washed free|Phí có điện thường/vật liệu vệ sinh nhưng người thuê dọn rác/bề mặt; báo lỗi trước nấu; giữ đồ ngoài giờ cần thỏa thuận riêng.
Parcel address verification|To: Online shop team\nPlease verify an address change through the customer's established account before redirecting a high-value parcel. A message containing the order number alone is not sufficient evidence, since that number may appear on forwarded correspondence. Keep the original destination until verification is complete. If the parcel has already left the depot, use the carrier's redirection procedure rather than editing our local order record and assuming the driver will see it.|To explain how to verify and process redirections~To authorize every emailed address change~To guarantee local edits reach every driver~To remove carrier tracking procedures|A local record edit may not redirect a dispatched parcel~An order number alone always proves identity~Verification happens after delivery~Every address change must be rejected|Use the established account and appropriate carrier procedure~Redirect solely from a forwarded message~Edit locally and assume dispatch changed~Delete the original destination before checking|Xác minh qua tài khoản đã có; riêng mã đơn chưa đủ; hàng đã xuất phải đổi qua quy trình hãng vận chuyển, sửa hồ sơ nội bộ không tự báo tài xế.
Staff bicycle loans|BICYCLE LOAN SCHEME\nStaff can borrow a company bicycle for approved local business trips. The booking includes a lock and helmet, which must be returned with the bicycle. Loans for commuting are available under a separate pilot and require an additional agreement. Before departure, report any visible fault to facilities; a confirmed booking does not establish that a bicycle is roadworthy. If in doubt, use another travel option until the bicycle is checked.|To distinguish business bicycle loans from a commuting pilot~To authorize every personal trip~To guarantee mechanical condition through booking~To offer free permanent bicycles|A booking is not proof of roadworthiness~Commuting needs no separate agreement~Helmets may be kept permanently~Visible faults should be ignored after booking|Report faults before using the bicycle~Ride regardless of a visible fault~Assume all personal travel is approved~Return the bicycle without its accessories|Xe mượn cho công tác địa phương; đi làm có thỏa thuận riêng; đặt thành công không chứng minh xe an toàn; báo lỗi và trả đủ phụ kiện.
Design review availability|To: Project leads\nThe design-review panel meets on alternate Thursdays. Submit materials by the preceding Monday to be considered for that meeting. A submission acknowledgement confirms receipt, not approval or a guaranteed place on the agenda. Urgent requests should explain the consequence of waiting; the panel chair decides whether an additional review is justified. Please do not begin work requiring approval solely because the files have been uploaded.|To clarify design-review submission status~To approve every uploaded design automatically~To require work before review~To replace the panel chair|Acknowledgement confirms receipt rather than approval~Every upload guarantees an agenda place~All urgent requests bypass the chair~The panel meets every Monday|Wait for the required decision before starting controlled work~Treat an upload as approval~Ignore the preceding-Monday deadline~Assume urgency alone guarantees a review|Xác nhận đã nhận khác phê duyệt; nộp trước thứ Hai để xét kỳ thứ Năm cách tuần; yêu cầu gấp do chủ tịch quyết, không tự làm chỉ vì tải lên.
Photograph commission rights|PHOTOGRAPHY AGREEMENT\nThe commission includes use of the selected images on the client's website and in one printed annual report. It does not transfer ownership of all photographs taken during the session. Use in paid advertising requires separate written permission. The photographer will supply credited image files and a use summary with the final invoice. Please keep that summary with the files so future staff can check the permitted scope before reusing them.|To describe the scope of a photography license~To transfer every image's ownership automatically~To authorize all paid advertising~To prohibit the agreed website use|Paid advertising needs additional written permission~The commission grants every possible use~Only unselected images may be published~The use summary can be discarded immediately|Keep the rights summary with the image files~Assume payment transfers all ownership~Use every image in any campaign~Remove all credit information|Quyền gồm web và một báo cáo năm in, không chuyển sở hữu toàn bộ; quảng cáo trả phí cần phép riêng; giữ bản tóm tắt quyền cùng ảnh.
Hotel meeting refreshment order|To: Event organizers\nRefreshment numbers must be confirmed two working days before your meeting. We can reduce the order before that deadline, but late reductions do not lower the guaranteed catering charge. Additional portions may be possible if stock permits and will be billed separately. Meeting-room capacity and refreshment numbers are separate; ordering more coffee does not authorize extra attendees beyond the room's approved limit.|To explain catering-order changes~To raise room capacity through drink orders~To guarantee unlimited extra portions~To cancel all late meetings|Late reductions do not reduce the guaranteed charge~Any reduction always produces a refund~More refreshments increase legal room capacity~Extra portions are always free|Confirm numbers before the stated deadline~Use a coffee order as capacity approval~Assume stock for every late addition~Reduce the guaranteed charge unilaterally|Hai ngày làm việc là hạn chốt suất; giảm muộn không giảm phí cam kết; thêm tùy kho và tính riêng, không đổi sức chứa phòng.
Archive image requests|DIGITAL COPY SERVICE\nResearchers may request scans of cataloged archive items. The service fee covers staff time and file delivery, not permission to publish material whose rights belong to another party. A scan supplied for private research may therefore need further clearance before appearing in a book or website. Fragile items can be excluded from scanning if handling would risk damage. We will explain any restriction before processing payment.|To distinguish copying services from publication permission~To authorize all publication through a service payment~To guarantee scans of every fragile item~To sell ownership of archival works|A scanning fee does not automatically clear publication rights~Private-research scans may always be posted publicly~Every fragile item must be scanned~Restrictions are announced only after payment|Check rights separately before publishing~Treat delivery of a file as unrestricted ownership~Demand risky handling after paying~Assume every catalog entry is publishable|Phí là công quét/gửi file, không tự cấp quyền xuất bản; bản nghiên cứu riêng muốn đăng cần kiểm quyền; đồ dễ hỏng có thể không quét.
Staff survey interpretation|MANAGEMENT NOTE\nThe latest staff survey has a higher satisfaction average than last year's. However, response rates differ substantially between departments, and several small teams had no respondents. Please review participation alongside the average before describing the result as representative of every employee. The people team will invite missing teams to a separate listening session. Those comments will add context rather than being retroactively counted as original survey responses.|To caution against overgeneralizing survey results~To declare every employee satisfied~To erase low-response departments~To replace all evidence with a single average|Uneven participation limits the interpretation~Every team was equally represented~Later comments were original survey responses~A higher average proves every individual improved|Review participation and gather additional context~Call the average representative without checking~Invent responses for missing teams~Count later interviews as original survey forms|Trung bình tăng nhưng phản hồi lệch giữa bộ phận; cần xét độ tham gia, không đại diện mọi người; phỏng vấn bổ sung là bối cảnh, không ghi ngược thành phiếu cũ.
Return delivery labels|RETURN LABEL NOTICE\nA prepaid return label is valid for one parcel only. If an order arrived in two cartons, contact support before returning both; copying the same label onto a second carton can cause tracking and billing errors. Pack accessories with the item they belong to and retain proof of handover. A label being generated does not mean the carrier has collected the parcel or that a refund has already been approved.|To explain correct use of return labels~To confirm automatic refunds when labels are printed~To authorize duplicate labels on any number of cartons~To remove tracking requirements|Generating a label is different from collection or refund approval~Every printed label proves collection~One label covers unlimited parcels~Proof of handover is unnecessary|Ask support about a multi-carton return~Copy one label onto every carton~Discard the handover receipt~Expect a refund before any review|Một nhãn cho một kiện; hai thùng phải hỏi hỗ trợ, không sao chép nhãn; tạo nhãn khác việc đã lấy hàng hay duyệt hoàn tiền.
External-speaker access|SPEAKER INFORMATION\nGuest speakers should send presentation files by Wednesday for a compatibility check. This check confirms that files open on our equipment; it does not approve their factual claims or grant permission to use third-party images. Speakers remain responsible for those matters. A live demonstration using an external service should include an offline fallback, since venue internet access is shared. Tell the coordinator if your demonstration needs a restricted network setting.|To clarify the scope of a presentation check~To certify every speaker claim automatically~To grant all image licenses~To guarantee dedicated internet for each guest|Compatibility checking does not validate factual content~Every opened file is factually approved~The venue clears all third-party rights~No offline fallback is useful|Provide a fallback for an online demonstration~Assume shared internet is guaranteed dedicated service~Skip image-rights checks~Send no files before arriving|Kiểm tương thích chỉ xem mở được, không thẩm định nội dung hay cấp quyền ảnh; trình diễn online cần phương án ngoại tuyến vì mạng dùng chung.
Local delivery packaging|To: Suppliers\nOur receiving team can accept reusable transport crates, provided the collection arrangement is agreed before delivery. Please label each crate with the supplier name and collection reference. Unannounced reusable packaging may be treated as standard packaging because staff will not know it must be retained. The agreement covers empty-crate storage for seven days after delivery; longer storage requires a separate arrangement, especially during peak stock periods.|To explain conditions for returnable delivery packaging~To offer unlimited empty-crate storage~To require all suppliers to use disposable cartons~To transfer ownership of every crate|Reusable packaging needs a prior collection arrangement~Staff automatically recognize every returnable crate~Seven days means permanent storage~Labels are unnecessary|Agree collection details before sending reusable crates~Send unmarked returnables without notice~Assume indefinite storage is included~Use the delivery date as automatic collection proof|Hộp vận chuyển tái sử dụng cần thỏa thuận lấy lại trước, ghi nguồn/mã; chỉ giữ trống7ngày, lâu hơn thỏa thuận riêng.
Mentor meeting confidentiality|MENTORING GUIDE\nMentoring conversations are private, but mentors cannot promise absolute secrecy where a serious safety or safeguarding concern requires escalation under policy. Explain that boundary at the first meeting rather than after an issue arises. Mentors should not keep unnecessary detailed personal notes. A short record of agreed development actions is usually enough, and participants should know where it is stored and who can access it.|To explain boundaries in mentoring confidentiality~To promise secrecy under every circumstance~To require extensive private dossiers~To assign mentors promotion authority|Some serious concerns may require escalation~Every conversation must be publicly shared~No confidentiality boundary should be discussed~Mentors must record every personal detail|Discuss the boundary at the first meeting~Promise unlimited secrecy~Collect unnecessary personal histories~Hide all record-storage arrangements|Trao đổi riêng tư vẫn có ngoại lệ cần báo theo chính sách an toàn nghiêm trọng; nói ranh giới ngay buổi đầu, chỉ ghi hành động phát triển cần thiết.
Community solar information|SOLAR INFORMATION EVENING\nThe council's event will compare rooftop-solar options for residents. Presenters will explain typical costs and questions to ask installers, but they will not provide a binding quotation for an individual property. Roof condition, shading, and electrical arrangements need a site-specific assessment. Attendance is free, and no purchase is required. Residents should treat examples as illustrations rather than guaranteed savings for every household.|To explain the scope of a public information event~To guarantee identical savings for all homes~To require a solar purchase at the event~To provide binding quotations without inspection|Individual properties require specific assessment~An example is a guaranteed household saving~Every roof has identical shading~Attendance obliges residents to buy|Use examples as guidance and seek a site assessment~Treat every illustration as a binding quote~Skip roof-condition checks~Pay for equipment merely to attend|Buổi thông tin giải thích chi phí mẫu/câu hỏi cho nhà lắp đặt, không báo giá ràng buộc; từng mái cần đánh giá, ví dụ không cam kết tiết kiệm.
Equipment sharing calendar|TEAM EQUIPMENT CALENDAR\nA calendar reservation prevents overlapping bookings but does not transfer responsibility for checking equipment before use. Report damage when collecting an item, not only when returning it. Accessories are listed in the checkout record and must travel with the equipment. If a project is canceled, release the slot promptly; keeping an unused reservation can prevent another team from meeting its deadline. Training requirements still apply to specialist tools.|To explain responsible use of shared equipment~To certify equipment through calendar booking~To waive training for specialist tools~To encourage holding unused slots|Reservations do not replace condition checks~All booked equipment is automatically certified safe~Accessories may be retained separately~Canceled projects should keep their slots|Release reservations that are no longer needed~Ignore visible collection-time damage~Use specialist tools without training~Keep accessories after return|Lịch chỉ tránh trùng, không thay kiểm tra trạng thái/chứng nhận; lấy thấy hỏng phải báo, trả đủ phụ kiện; hủy dự án thì nhả chỗ.
Limited exhibition extension|VISITOR UPDATE\nThe photography exhibition has been extended until Sunday, but guided evening tours still end on Friday as originally advertised. Standard daytime admission continues through the extension, and existing unused daytime tickets remain valid. A ticket for a specific evening tour cannot be used for an unscheduled tour on Saturday. Contact the booking desk if you cannot attend your reserved evening; staff can explain the applicable exchange options.|To distinguish an exhibition extension from tour availability~To add evening tours automatically on every extra day~To invalidate all daytime tickets~To cancel the photography exhibition|Evening tours do not extend with daytime access~Saturday evening tours are automatically included~Unused daytime tickets all expire Friday~Every ticket is interchangeable without conditions|Ask the desk about a reserved evening that cannot be used~Arrive for an unscheduled Saturday evening tour~Discard a still-valid daytime ticket~Assume every extension creates new guided slots|Triển lãm thêm đến Chủ nhật nhưng tour tối vẫn hết thứ Sáu; vé ngày chưa dùng còn hiệu lực; vé tối có lịch không tự tạo suất thứ Bảy.
'''
